# 统一行尾，避免 Windows / macOS / Linux 之间来回改行尾产生无意义的 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须是 CRLF：LF 结尾的 .bat 在 cmd.exe 里跳转标签、拼接语句都可能出错
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Shell 脚本必须是 LF，否则在某些系统上会报 "bad interpreter"
*.sh text eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.db binary
*.node binary
